<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - WESTERN DEEPS Q2 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - WESTERN DEEPS Q2 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus</p>
<p>preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit			  46.0 vs 35.6</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 8,892 vs 7,770</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	    1,150,000 vs 1,183,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    7.73 vs 6.57</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  42,956 vs 46,973</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     51,794 vs 52,541</p>
<p>Full name: Western Deep Levels Ltd owned by Anglo American</p>
